message: "If Nodus contributes substantially to research that leads to a publication, please cite the software using these metadata."
title: "Nodus"
abstract: >-
  Nodus is the open-source desktop application developed by the Nodus
  Research project. It provides local-first workspaces for academic
  research, teaching, study and structured data.
